Evergreen-Patch: installer-title
Why: The installer .exe first unpacks itself, showing a progress window
  titled from app.tag: "Mozilla Firefox". Title it Evergreen.
Upstream: not upstreamable (the brand name is hard-coded upstream)
Drop-when: Firefox takes the self-extractor's title from the branding
Owner: Evergreen maintainers

--- a/browser/installer/windows/app.tag
+++ b/browser/installer/windows/app.tag
@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
 ;!@Install@!UTF-8!
-Title="Mozilla Firefox"
+Title="Evergreen"
 RunProgram="setup.exe"
